<title>USA: Titan Pharmaceuticals names Farrell CFO.</title>
<headline>Titan Pharmaceuticals names Farrell CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Pharmaceuticals Inc said Robert Farrell has joined the company as executive vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>From 1982 to 1990,  Farrell served as vice president of finance for Genstar Corp.</p>
<p>President of its TXL Securities Division. In 1991, Mr. Farrell became Chief Financial Officer of Fresenius USA, Inc. (AMEX: FRN), then known as Delmed, Inc., a manufacturer and distributor of medical products for treating kidney failure.</p>
<p>The company said Farrell's appointment was a new position.</p>
</text>
